docs {
  # GET /api/sales/?stripe_code=invalid — Not found exemplar

  Demonstrates intentional `401` for unknown `stripe_code` (not `404`). Requires `Authorization: Token {{token}}`. Source: `travels/views.py:52-60`.

  ## Status codes

  - `401 Unauthorized` — sale not found (intentional reuse, `views.py:75`)

  ## Response (401)

  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Sale not found",
    "data": {}
  }
  ```

  Compare with `get_by_stripe_code.bru` `200` and `_auth/get_unauthenticated.bru` `401 Invalid token.` and `post_create_invalid_vip_code.bru` `401 Invalid VIP code` — three distinct `401` shapes.
}
